# Intrinsic Valuation and Discounted Cash Flows
**Intrinsic valuation derives the value of an equity from the expected cash flows it generates, discounted at a rate that reflects their riskiness. Damodaran frames discounted cash flow valuation as the foundational approach for estimating the value of any asset.**
